Comments:
    Checks that various quantities are output at the correct time, by solving
    the evolution equation df/dt = 1. Default test program tests only time
    series; to test snapshots, averages, and slices, use the
    Python script tests feature: `pc_auto-test --script-tests=python`.
    
    Succeeds on CPUs and GPUs (latter with ASTAROTH_CPU_BUILD=on)
    
    Power spectra are still output with an offset of one timestep; while this is
    trivial to fix (see comments in run.f90:gen_output), fixing it breaks the
    autotests (reference data needs to be updated).
